1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,019
Liquid nitrogen is nitrogen gas cooled to an incredibly low temperature.

2
00:00:05,019 --> 00:00:13,400
It boils at -196°C (-320°F), making it extremely cold!

3
00:00:13,400 --> 00:00:18,489
When liquid nitrogen touches something warmer, it rapidly absorbs heat.

4
00:00:18,490 --> 00:00:23,650
This heat absorption causes it to boil vigorously, turning into gas.

5
00:00:23,650 --> 00:00:28,190
It freezes objects instantly, making them brittle and fragile.

